#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:2
msgid "Imperative UI Guide"
msgstr "命令式开发指南"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **imperative track** (``fluxent.imp``) gives your C23 program direct "
"ownership over a retained ``XtkScene``, atomic ``XtkTxn`` transactions, "
"generated typed control wrappers in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``, and routed "
"``XtkEventFn`` callbacks."
msgstr ""
"**命令式路线** （ ``fluxent.imp`` ）赋予 C23 程序对保留式 ``XtkScene`` 、原子化 ``XtkTxn`` 事务、"
" ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 自动生成的强类型控件包装函数以及 ``XtkEventFn`` 路由事件回调的直接控制权。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"The imperative API is also Xent's stable C ABI surface: ``oxent`` (Rust),"
" ``zxent`` (Zig), ``xenthon`` (Python), and ``hsxent`` (Haskell) all "
"compile down to these functions."
msgstr ""
"命令式 API 同时也是 Xent 的稳定 C ABI 边界： ``oxent`` （Rust）、 ``zxent`` （Zig）、 "
"``xenthon`` （Python）与 ``hsxent`` （Haskell）均直接调用这组底层函数。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"Read the six chapters in sequence to go from basic window startup to "
"100,000-row virtualized collections and OS shell integration:"
msgstr "按顺序阅读以下六章，即可从基础窗口启动一路掌握 10 万行虚拟化集合与系统外壳集成："

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`lifecycle` — Initialize control modules, ``FluxApp``, ``XtkHost``, "
"and ``XtkScene``, dissect the ``fluxent.imp`` template, and shut down "
"cleanly."
msgstr ""
":doc:`lifecycle` —— 初始化控件模块、 ``FluxApp`` 、 ``XtkHost`` 与 ``XtkScene`` ，"
"拆解 ``fluxent.imp`` 模板并按规范顺序释放资源。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:18
msgid ""
":doc:`transactions` — Build, reparent, reorder, and swap dynamic page "
"subtrees atomically with ``XtkTxn``, ``XtkNodeRef``, ``XtkBatchResult``, "
"and ``XtkBatchDiag``."
msgstr ""
":doc:`transactions` —— 使用 ``XtkTxn`` 、 ``XtkNodeRef`` 、 ``XtkBatchResult`` 与 "
"``XtkBatchDiag`` 原子化构建、重排、重挂载并切换动态页面子树。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`properties` — Master ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` ``.set`` bitmasks, "
"string length conventions, reusable Flex layout helpers, generic property"
" queries, and composite data setters."
msgstr ""
":doc:`properties` —— 掌握 ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 的 ``.set`` 属性位掩码、字符串长度约定、"
"可复用的 Flex 布局辅助函数、通用属性读取与复合数据设置函数。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:24
msgid ""
":doc:`events` — Subscribe to capture/target/bubble event phases, decode "
"``XtkEventPayload`` variants, coalesce per-frame UI syncs with "
"``flux_app_onframe``, and coordinate controlled inputs with "
"``XtkChangeStamp``."
msgstr ""
":doc:`events` —— 订阅捕获/目标/冒泡阶段事件，解析各类 ``XtkEventPayload`` 载荷，"
"通过 ``flux_app_onframe`` 合并帧内属性同步，并用 ``XtkChangeStamp`` 协调受控输入。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:28
msgid ""
":doc:`virtualization` — Drive 100,000-row ``ListView`` and ``GridView`` "
"controls imperatively via ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE``, slot recycling, and "
"sticky group headers."
msgstr ""
":doc:`virtualization` —— 基于 ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` 视口范围事件、行槽位复用与吸顶组标题，"
"以命令式方式驱动 10 万行 ``ListView`` 与 ``GridView`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/index.rst:31
msgid ""
":doc:`shell` — Control modal ``ContentDialog`` instances, open native "
"file dialogs, handle ``FluxData`` clipboard and drag-and-drop payloads, "
"customize window chrome, and marshal worker-thread callbacks."
msgstr ""
":doc:`shell` —— 控制模态 ``ContentDialog`` 、调用原生文件对话框、处理 ``FluxData`` "
"剪贴板与 OLE 拖放数据、定制窗口外观并从工作线程回调 UI 线程。"
